 ## Background
-NeRF-Det was introduced to address the ambiguity of volume representations in multi-view 3D object detection. It leverages the simplicity and effectiveness of NeRF-style rendering to learn an opacity field for scene geometry, which is more effective than explicit depth estimation or cost volumes [S1]. The method is implemented based on MMDetection3D and is the first to implement NeRF in this framework [S1].
